              "content": "=You are a professional LinkedIn content writer and personal branding expert.\n\nI will provide you with raw data/information generated by AI. Your job is to transform it into a polished, professional, engaging, and credible LinkedIn post.\n\nRequirements:\n\n* Keep the information factually consistent with the provided data.\n* Do not invent statistics, facts, achievements, or sources.\n* Start with a strong and professional hook that grabs attention.\n* Explain the key insight clearly in simple, professional English.\n* Make the post valuable and easy to read.\n* Use short paragraphs and natural spacing.\n* Highlight important points using simple bullet points when appropriate.\n* Maintain a confident but humble professional tone.\n* Avoid exaggerated marketing language and unnecessary emojis.\n* Add a thoughtful conclusion or takeaway.\n* End with a relevant question that encourages meaningful discussion.\n* Add 3–5 relevant LinkedIn hashtags.\n* Optimize the post for LinkedIn readability and professional audience engagement.\n* Do not make it sound robotic or obviously AI-generated.\n* Keep the final post concise, preferably between 150–250 words.\n\nRaw AI-generated data:\n{{ $json.data.web[0].title }}\n\nURL:\n{{ $json.data.web[0].url }}\n\nPrevious generated post (if available):\n{{ $json.previous_post || \"No previous post available.\" }}\n\nUser feedback on the previous post (if available):\n{{ $json.feedback || \"No feedback provided. Create the post normally.\" }}\n\nIf user feedback is provided, revise the previous post according to that feedback while keeping the original facts and source information accurate.\n\nNow create or regenerate the professional LinkedIn post.\n"
            }
